cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it. The associated paper is named in
  the README; add its citation here once it has a DOI.
title: >-
  Multimodal Prediction of Post-COVID Condition (PCC) — Analysis Pipeline
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis pipeline for multimodal prediction of post-COVID
  condition (PCC) in the German National Cohort (NAKO): nested 10x5
  cross-validation with per-modality base learners, stability selection,
  DML orthogonalisation, and an XGBoost meta-learner.
type: software
